                <mxCell id="r1_mha_wb" value="MHA under TP" style="swimlane;startSize=22;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#e65100;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;rounded=1;" parent="r1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="15" y="580" width="490" height="190" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r1_mha_detail" value="• KV heads are SHARDED across TP ranks&#10;  Rank 0: heads [0 .. H/tp-1]&#10;  Rank 1: heads [H/tp .. 2H/tp-1]&#10;&#10;• ALL ranks must write to L3&#10;  (each has unique data)&#10;&#10;• L3 key includes tp_rank and tp_size:&#10;  hash_{model}_tp0_tp2  vs  hash_{model}_tp1_tp2&#10;&#10;• On prefetch: each rank reads its own shard" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" parent="r1_mha_wb" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="5" y="25" width="480" height="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r1_mla_wb" value="MLA under TP" style="swimlane;startSize=22;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1565c0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;rounded=1;" parent="r1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="530" y="580" width="490" height="190" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r1_mla_detail" value="• All ranks hold IDENTICAL full latent KV&#10;  (no sharding, redundant storage)&#10;&#10;• Only Rank 0 writes to L3&#10;  Other ranks: backup_skip = True&#10;  (avoid redundant storage)&#10;&#10;• L3 key does NOT include tp_rank:&#10;  hash_{model}  (same for all ranks)&#10;&#10;• On prefetch: all ranks read same data" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" parent="r1_mla_wb" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="5" y="25" width="480" height="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
