                <mxCell id="pov_flow" value="Per PP stage: separate HiRadixCache, HiCacheController, L1/L2. TP all_reduce(MIN) only within the stage.&#10;Activations flow stage k → k+1 (no shared HiCache tree). L3 keys include pp_rank (+ tp_rank for MHA)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=9;fontColor=#880e4f;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="pov">
